{"item_uid": "學測94-math-003", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 3, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "台北銀行最早發行的樂透彩(俗稱小樂透)的玩法是「42選6」：購買者從01~42中任選六個\n號碼，當這六個號碼與開出的六個號碼完全相同(不計次序)時即得頭獎；台北銀行曾考慮改\n發行「39選5」的小小樂透：購買者從01~39中任選五個號碼，如果這五個號碼與開出的五\n個號碼完全相同(不計次序)則得頭獎。假設原來的小樂透中頭獎的機率是R，而曾考慮發行\nr\n的小小樂透中頭獎的機率是r。試問比值 最接近下列哪個選項？\nR\n(1) 3 (2) 5 (3) 7 (4) 9 (5) 11", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"1": 9.0, "2": 15.0, "3": 18.0, "4": 52.0, "5": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 3.0, "2": 5.0, "3": 5.0, "4": 82.0, "5": 4.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 14.0, "2": 22.0, "3": 35.0, "4": 20.0, "5": 8.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 52.0, "p_high": 82.0, "p_low": 20.0, "discrimination": 62.0, "p_quintiles": [88.0, 70.0, 53.0, 34.0, 14.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-math-004", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 4, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "設a, b為正實數，已知log a=11,log b=13；試問log (a+b)之值最接近下列哪個選項？\n7 7 7\n(1) 12 (2) 13 (3) 14 (4) 23 (5) 24", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"1": 9.0, "2": 32.0, "3": 17.0, "4": 11.0, "5": 30.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 7.0, "2": 65.0, "3": 14.0, "4": 5.0, "5": 10.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 10.0, "2": 10.0, "3": 18.0, "4": 15.0, "5": 46.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 32.0, "p_high": 65.0, "p_low": 10.0, "discrimination": 55.0, "p_quintiles": [76.0, 42.0, 22.0, 13.0, 9.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-math-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 5, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "某校高一第一次段考數學成績不太理想，多數同學成績偏低；考慮到可能是同學們適應不良\n所致，數學老師決定將每人的原始成績取平方根後再乘以10作為正式紀錄的成績。今隨機\n抽選100位同學，發現調整後的成績其平均為65分，標準差為15分；試問這100位同學\n未調整前的成績之平均M介於哪兩個連續正整數之間？(第7頁附有標準差公式)\n(1) 40≤M＜41 (2) 41≤M＜42 (3) 42≤M＜43 (4) 43≤M＜44 (5) 44≤M＜45\n-1-\n94學年度 第2頁\n數學考科 共7頁\n貳 、 多 選 題", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"1": 6.0, "2": 18.0, "3": 57.0, "4": 11.0, "5": 8.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 2.0, "2": 9.0, "3": 72.0, "4": 5.0, "5": 10.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 10.0, "2": 24.0, "3": 43.0, "4": 15.0, "5": 7.0}, "omit_rate": 1.0, "p_value": 8.0, "p_high": 10.0, "p_low": 7.0, "discrimination": 3.0, "p_quintiles": [12.0, 7.0, 7.0, 8.0, 6.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
