{"item_uid": "學測94-math-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 7, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "如右圖所示，坐標平面上一鳶形ABCD，其中A,C在\ny\ny-軸上，B,D在x-軸上，且AB= AD＝2，BC =CD=4，\nA\nAC＝5。令m 、m 、m 、m 分別表直線 AB、\nAB BC CD DA\nBC、CD、DA之斜率。試問以下哪些敘述成立？\nx\n(1) 此四數值中以m 為最大 B D\nAB\n(2) 此四數值中以m 為最小\nBC\n(3) m ＝－m\nBC CD C\n(4) m × m ＝－1\nAB BC\n(5) m ＋m ＞0\nCD DA", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"1": 18.0, "2": 72.0, "3": 82.0, "4": 18.0, "5": 72.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 4.0, "2": 93.0, "3": 94.0, "4": 2.0, "5": 91.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 30.0, "2": 49.0, "3": 65.0, "4": 38.0, "5": 52.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 56.0, "p_high": 87.0, "p_low": 22.0, "discrimination": 65.0, "p_quintiles": [91.0, 77.0, 58.0, 36.0, 15.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-math-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "假設坐標空間中三相異平面E 、E 、E 皆通過(－1,2,0)與(3,0,2)兩點，試問以下哪些點也同\n1 2 3\n時在此三平面上？\n(1) (2,2,2) (2) (1,1,1) (3) (4,－2,2) (4) (－2,4,0) (5) (－5,－4,－2)\n- 2 -\n第3頁 94學年度\n共7頁 數學考科\nπ", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"1": 37.0, "2": 65.0, "3": 44.0, "4": 40.0, "5": 21.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 16.0, "2": 87.0, "3": 22.0, "4": 19.0, "5": 15.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 50.0, "2": 48.0, "3": 57.0, "4": 51.0, "5": 24.0}, "omit_rate": 2.0, "p_value": 34.0, "p_high": 67.0, "p_low": 13.0, "discrimination": 54.0, "p_quintiles": [81.0, 42.0, 21.0, 15.0, 12.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-math-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "若0<θ< ，試問以下哪些選項恆成立？\n4\n(1) sinθ<cosθ (2) tanθ<sinθ (3) cosθ<tanθ\nθ 1\n(4) sin2θ<cos2θ (5) tan < tanθ\n2 2\nx2 y2", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"1": 70.0, "2": 33.0, "3": 35.0, "4": 27.0, "5": 60.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 93.0, "2": 16.0, "3": 14.0, "4": 7.0, "5": 76.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 47.0, "2": 47.0, "3": 54.0, "4": 45.0, "5": 43.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 37.0, "p_high": 69.0, "p_low": 10.0, "discrimination": 59.0, "p_quintiles": [77.0, 52.0, 31.0, 16.0, 8.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
