{"item_uid": "學測94-math-011", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 11, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "設S為空間中一球面，AB為其一直徑，且AB＝10。若P為空間中一點，使得PA＋PB＝\n14， 則P點的位置可能落在哪裡？\n(1) 線段AB上；\n(2) 直線AB上，但不在線段AB上；\n(3) 球面S上；\n(4) 球S的內部，但不在線段AB上；\n(5) 球S的外部，但不在直線AB上。\n-3-\n94學年度 第4頁\n數學考科 共7頁\n第 二 部 分 ： 填 充 題", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"1": 11.0, "2": 76.0, "3": 60.0, "4": 64.0, "5": 53.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 2.0, "2": 94.0, "3": 69.0, "4": 72.0, "5": 64.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 22.0, "2": 58.0, "3": 53.0, "4": 55.0, "5": 42.0}, "omit_rate": 1.0, "p_value": 32.0, "p_high": 51.0, "p_low": 15.0, "discrimination": 36.0, "p_quintiles": [58.0, 38.0, 29.0, 22.0, 11.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
